# The repository is authored on Windows and runs in a Linux container, so line
# endings are normalised in git rather than left to each checkout.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Shell scripts and Dockerfiles are executed by Linux tooling; CRLF breaks a
# shebang and silently corrupts a heredoc.
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf

# PowerShell on Windows is happier with CRLF, and these scripts run on both.
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# Keep evidence captures byte-stable: a gate report cites them, and a line
# ending rewrite would change a file that is supposed to be a record.
*.jsonl -text

# Binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.nupkg binary
*.db binary
